# Native animation — Cubic and quadratic residues
# A moving cubic x term crosses a quadratic y field modulo 31.

:mim 1

:param phase number = 0
:vary phase from 0 to 31 over 12s loop

:axis x integers
:axis y integers

# Unequal powers break radial symmetry into curved modular streams.
:field mod((x + phase) * (x + phase) * (x + phase) + y * y, 31)
:lens value

# Exact colors reveal which streams share the same remainder.
:color exact(lens)
:overlay equality off
